        </p>
      </div>

      <Card size="sm" id="github-oauth">
        <CardHeader>
          <CardTitle>GitHub OAuth</CardTitle>
          <CardDescription>
            <a
              href="https://docs.github.com/en/apps/oauth-apps/building-oauth-apps/creating-an-oauth-app"
              className="text-primary underline"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noreferrer"
